  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A particle moves in a circle at constant speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>. The frequency of the particles rotation is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span>. What is the diameter of the circle?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v}{\\pi f}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v}{2 \\pi f}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{fv}{\\pi}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{fv}{2 \\pi}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
